## Why This Is Asked

Assess practical understanding of serverless data ingestion on AWS, IAM least privilege, and TLS enforcement.

## Key Concepts

- TLS endpoint
- IAM roles and trust policies for Lambda
- S3 bucket policy scoped to path and principal
- Simple integration test with canaries

## Code Example

```javascript
// Lambda writes payload to S3
const AWS = require('aws-sdk');
const s3 = new AWS.S3();
exports.handler = async (event) => {
  const body = event.body || JSON.stringify(event);
  const date = new Date().toISOString().substring(0,10);
  const key = `logs/${date}/payload.json`;
  await s3.putObject({Bucket: process.env.BUCKET, Key: key, Body: body, ContentType: 'application/json'}).promise();
  return {statusCode: 200, body: 'ok'};
};
```

